# v3c = paper recipe SFT_near-miss (2026-10-23): clean mix (data v2) with 1,500 public trajectories replaced by near-miss
# declines (public request + same-topic tools that cannot serve it; gold = the base model's own decline). data/sft/v3c
--objective sft
--sft_files data/sft/v3c/sft_train.jsonl
--val_files data/sft/v3c/sft_val.jsonl
--epochs 2
--micro_batch 2
--accum 16
--grad_ckpt
--cache_dir data/cache
